# Llamadas de prueba a /api/branches.
### Alta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mafalda Alberti",
  "address": "Alberti 555",
  "phone": "2236859158",
  "pointOfSale": 16
}

### Listado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches

### Una sucursal (cambiar el id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches/1

### Editar
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/branches/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Local centro",
  "address": "San Martín 120",
  "phone": "261-0000000",
  "pointOfSale": 1
}

### Baja lógica
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/branches/1

### Reactivar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/branches/1/activate
